<?php defined('BASEPATH') OR exit('No direct script access allowed');$isEdit=!empty($inspection['id']);$itemValues=array();foreach(isset($inspection['rows'])?$inspection['rows']:array() as $existingRow){$itemValues[$existingRow['item_id']]=$existingRow;} ?>
<form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="<?= $actionUrl; ?>" data-lc-form><input type="hidden" name="action" value="inspection_save"><?php if($isEdit): ?><input type="hidden" name="inspection_id" value="<?= (int)$inspection['id']; ?>"><?php endif; ?><?php if(!empty($inspection['revision_of'])): ?><input type="hidden" name="revision_of" value="<?= (int)$inspection['revision_of']; ?>"><?php endif; ?><div class="lc-fields"><label>Jenis pemeriksaan<select name="stage" required><?php foreach($isEdit?array($inspection['stage']):array('check_in','routine','check_out') as $stage): ?><option value="<?= $stage; ?>" <?= gh_lc_v($inspection,'stage','check_in')===$stage?'selected':''; ?>><?= gh_lc_label($stage); ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label><label>Tanggal pemeriksaan aktual<input type="date" name="check_date" max="<?= date('Y-m-d'); ?>" <?= $isEdit?'readonly':''; ?> value="<?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($inspection,'check_date',date('Y-m-d'))); ?>" required></label><label>Periode pemeriksaan<input type="month" name="period" <?= $isEdit?'readonly':''; ?> value="<?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($inspection,'period',date('Y-m'))); ?>" required></label><label>Nama petugas<input name="officer_name" maxlength="150" value="<?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($inspection,'officer_name',$this->session->userdata('gh_admin_name'))); ?>" required></label><label>Scan formulir bertanda tangan <?= $isEdit?'(opsional jika tidak diganti)':'*'; ?><input type="file" name="scan_file" accept=".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png" <?= $isEdit?'':'required'; ?>><span class="lc-help">PDF/JPG/PNG maksimal 10 MB; tulisan dan tanda tangan harus terbaca.</span></label><label>Foto kondisi fasilitas (opsional)<input type="file" name="photo_file" accept=".jpg,.jpeg,.png"><span class="lc-help">JPG/PNG maksimal 10 MB.</span></label></div><div class="lc-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Fasilitas</th><th>Standar</th><th>Aktual</th><th>Kondisi sesuai scan</th><th>Keterangan</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($inventory_items as $item):$iid=(int)$item['id'];$val=isset($itemValues[$iid])?$itemValues[$iid]:array(); ?><tr><td><strong><?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($item,'item_name',gh_lc_v($item,'name'))); ?></strong></td><td><?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($item,'standard_qty',gh_lc_v($item,'quantity',1))); ?></td><td><input type="number" name="items[<?= $iid; ?>][actual_qty]" min="0" max="9999" value="<?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($val,'actual_qty','')); ?>" required aria-label="Jumlah aktual <?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($item,'item_name',gh_lc_v($item,'name'))); ?>"></td><td><select name="items[<?= $iid; ?>][condition_status]" required aria-label="Kondisi <?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($item,'item_name',gh_lc_v($item,'name'))); ?>"><?php foreach(array('uninspected','good','needs_repair','damaged','missing','not_available') as $condition): ?><option value="<?= $condition; ?>" <?= gh_lc_v($val,'condition_status','uninspected')===$condition?'selected':''; ?>><?= gh_lc_label($condition); ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></td><td><textarea name="items[<?= $iid; ?>][notes]" maxlength="1500" aria-label="Keterangan <?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($item,'item_name',gh_lc_v($item,'name'))); ?>"><?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($val,'notes','')); ?></textarea></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?><?php if(!$inventory_items): ?><tr><td colspan="5">Belum ada item inventaris untuk kamar ini. Lengkapi Master Inventaris terlebih dahulu.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div><label style="margin-top:16px">Catatan pemeriksaan / alasan revisi<textarea name="notes" maxlength="5000" <?= !empty($inspection['revision_of'])?'required':''; ?>><?= gh_lc_e(gh_lc_v($inspection,'notes','')); ?></textarea></label><div class="lc-form-footer"><button type="submit" <?= !$inventory_items?'disabled':''; ?>><?= $isEdit?'Simpan koreksi draf':'Simpan scan & draf pemeriksaan'; ?></button><span class="lc-help">Belum final; hasil perlu dicocokkan dengan dokumen fisik.</span></div></form>
